{"seq":3,"slug":"key-account-white-glove","title":"重点品牌 KA 落地陪跑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/invite-conversion-handoff/key-account-white-glove","wordCount":2229,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"重点品牌-ka-落地陪跑\">重点品牌 KA 落地陪跑</h1><p>30 家新入驻商家里，可能有 3 家贡献了 60% 的增量 GMV。这三家就是 KA（Key Account，重点客户）。它们的入驻值得投入远高于均值的资源——但「高于均值」这四个字如果不设边界，KA 陪跑就会变成一个人力黑洞：一个 BD 全职服务两个品牌，三个月后品牌还没上架，而 BD 的其他所有目标全部落空。</p>\n<p>本篇讲的是如何把 KA 陪跑变成一件<strong>有范围、有里程碑、有退出条件</strong>的工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-谁算-ka\">核心概念：谁算 KA</h2><p>KA 名单不能由 BD 申请、也不能由区域负责人指定，否则会变成人情资源。可用的判定方式是<strong>在入驻前</strong>用可观测信号给一个预期价值，达到阈值即自动进入 KA 流程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品牌力</td>\n<td>品牌在目标市场有独立站/门店/线下渠道</td>\n<td>品牌资产可迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类契合</td>\n<td>主营品类命中平台缺口模型的「质的缺口」格子</td>\n<td>对应 <a href=\"../recruit-planning-target/category-region-recruit-plan\">缺口模型</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规模下限</td>\n<td>现有渠道经营规模达到同类目中位数以上</td>\n<td>避免陪跑小商家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多市场潜力</td>\n<td>已在两个以上市场经营</td>\n<td>单次陪跑可复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀缺性</td>\n<td>该品牌进入可显著提升品类心智</td>\n<td>战略价值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"这套逻辑的通用形态-账号型拓展的分层\">这套逻辑的通用形态：账号型拓展的分层</h3><p>「少数账号贡献多数价值、因而值得单独投入与对口团队」这套逻辑，在 B2B 领域有一个成熟的名字：账号型营销（account-based marketing，ABM）。它把<strong>账号作为组织实体</strong>而不是把单个线索作为处理单位，并采用分层模型——最高价值账号走一对一高度定制（战略 ABM），一组需求相似的账号走一对少（ABM Lite），数十上百个账号走一对多的可编程化触达（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Account-based_marketing\">Account-based marketing</a>）。招商的 KA 陪跑正好对应这套分层的顶端：<strong>一对一配置专属陪跑资源</strong>。它的正当性来自同一个来源——账号型项目被广泛报告比传统需求获取有更高的回报，但前提是账号选择准确，否则投入会摊薄在没有价值的账号上。</p>\n<p>第五项「稀缺性」是唯一带主观判断的维度，因此它的使用方式应当受限：<strong>它只能用于把一家已经满足前四项的品牌从普通 KA 提升为战略 KA，不能用于让一家不满足前三项的品牌进入 KA 名单</strong>。这条约束把主观判断的影响限制在一档之内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陪跑的范围-到首批商品可售为止\">陪跑的范围：到首批商品可售为止</h2><p>KA 陪跑必须有明确的终点。<strong>推荐的终点是「首批商品上架并可售，且已产生首单」</strong>——不是「店铺开通」，也不是「长期合作顺畅」。理由是这个终点对应着一个客观事件，可以自动判定，也对应着平台投入的第一次真实回报。</p>\n<p>之后的经营成长（选品优化、广告投放、活动参与、供应链优化）属于<strong>商家成长/赋能</strong>的范畴，不在本 hub。这个边界必须写清楚，否则 KA 陪跑团队会持续被卷入长期运营，而招商侧的人力被固化在已招进来的商家身上，新招商停滞。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>里程碑</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>完成判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>M0 通过审核</td>\n<td>商家主体可用</td>\n<td>风控（见 3.2）</td>\n<td>审核状态 <code>approved</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M1 店铺就绪</td>\n<td>店铺配置、结算账户、物流方案确认</td>\n<td>KA 陪跑 + 商家</td>\n<td>店铺可创建商品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M2 首批商品</td>\n<td>≥N 个 SKU 完成上架并通过内容合规</td>\n<td>商家（陪跑协助）</td>\n<td>商品状态 <code>active</code> 且 N 达标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M3 首单产生</td>\n<td>首笔有效订单完成</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>订单状态 <code>completed</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M4 稳定经营</td>\n<td>连续 2 周有动销</td>\n<td>商家</td>\n<td>动销 SKU 数 ≥ 阈值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>M4 是可选的加项：对战略 KA 值得追踪，对一般 KA 在 M3 就可以退出陪跑。<strong>这四到五个里程碑必须由系统判定而不是由陪跑人填写</strong>——「商品状态 active」是一个数据库里的事实，不是一句汇报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陪跑的资源投入与计量\">陪跑的资源投入与计量</h2><p>KA 陪跑最常见的失控方式是<strong>没有工时计量</strong>。BD 说「我在服务 KA」，但没人知道花了多少时间、花在哪。可落地的做法是把陪跑动作也结构化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;ka_playbook&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;tier&quot;: &quot;strategic&quot;,&#10;    &quot;milestones&quot;: [&quot;M0&quot;, &quot;M1&quot;, &quot;M2&quot;, &quot;M3&quot;, &quot;M4&quot;],&#10;    &quot;budget&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;bd_hours_total&quot;: 120,&#10;      &quot;ops_support_hours_total&quot;: 60,&#10;      &quot;content_support_slots&quot;: 10,&#10;      &quot;policy_pack_ceiling&quot;: { &quot;fee_tier_stepdown&quot;: 2, &quot;subsidy_usd&quot;: 5000 }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;activities&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;setup_workshop&quot;, &quot;milestone&quot;: &quot;M1&quot;, &quot;est_hours&quot;: 8 },&#10;      { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;listing_content_review&quot;, &quot;milestone&quot;: &quot;M2&quot;, &quot;est_hours&quot;: 20 },&#10;      { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;logistics_deal_setup&quot;, &quot;milestone&quot;: &quot;M1&quot;, &quot;est_hours&quot;: 12 },&#10;      { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;first_order_support&quot;, &quot;milestone&quot;: &quot;M3&quot;, &quot;est_hours&quot;: 6 }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;exit_conditions&quot;: [&#10;      &quot;M3_completed_and_stable_14d&quot;,&#10;      &quot;budget_exhausted&quot;,&#10;      &quot;merchant_inactive_30d&quot;,&#10;      &quot;escalated_to_strategic_partnership&quot;&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ka_playbook\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"strategic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"milestones\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"bd_hours_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ops_support_hours_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"content_support_slots\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"policy_pack_ceiling\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fee_tier_stepdown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"subsidy_usd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"activities\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"setup_workshop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"milestone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"est_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"listing_content_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"milestone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"est_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"logistics_deal_setup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"milestone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"est_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"first_order_support\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"milestone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"M3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"est_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exit_conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"M3_completed_and_stable_14d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"budget_exhausted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"merchant_inactive_30d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"escalated_to_strategic_partnership\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"预算耗尽也是一条正常退出条件\">预算耗尽也是一条正常退出条件</h3><p><code>exit_conditions</code> 里最有价值的是 <code>budget_exhausted</code>：<strong>陪跑预算用完了就退出，无论里程碑是否达成</strong>。这一条把 KA 陪跑从「尽力而为」变成「有限投入」——如果 120 人时用完商家还没有上架，那说明这个商家的开办能力或意愿不足，正确的动作是转回常规通道并记录原因，而不是无限追加投入。</p>\n<p><code>merchant_inactive_30d</code> 同理：商家 30 天没有任何动作时，陪跑继续投入是浪费。这条规则需要与 <a href=\"../recruit-roi-ops/recruited-merchant-quality\">入驻商家质量与存活</a> 的预警信号联动——闲置超期是那里定义的核心预警之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陪跑中的跨团队协作\">陪跑中的跨团队协作</h2><p>KA 商家开办会牵动多个团队，这是普通商家入驻没有的复杂度：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[KA 陪跑负责人] --&gt; B[商家]&#10;  A --&gt; C[品类运营&lt;br/&gt;类目准入/坑位]&#10;  A --&gt; D[物流/履约&lt;br/&gt;方案与时效]&#10;  A --&gt; E[内容团队&lt;br/&gt;商品页与素材]&#10;  A --&gt; F[财务&lt;br/&gt;结算与账期]&#10;  A --&gt; G[风控&lt;br/&gt;资质与合规复查]&#10;  C --&gt; H{里程碑 M2}&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[首单 M3]&#10;  I --&gt; J[退出陪跑&lt;br/&gt;转常规运营]\">graph TD\n  A[KA 陪跑负责人] --&gt; B[商家]\n  A --&gt; C[品类运营&lt;br/&gt;类目准入/坑位]\n  A --&gt; D[物流/履约&lt;br/&gt;方案与时效]\n  A --&gt; E[内容团队&lt;br/&gt;商品页与素材]\n  A --&gt; F[财务&lt;br/&gt;结算与账期]\n  A --&gt; G[风控&lt;br/&gt;资质与合规复查]\n  C --&gt; H{里程碑 M2}\n  D --&gt; H\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[首单 M3]\n  I --&gt; J[退出陪跑&lt;br/&gt;转常规运营]</pre><h3 id=\"单点负责人与升级路径\">单点负责人与升级路径</h3><p>这张图的关键在于<strong>拓扑是星形而不是网状</strong>：只有 KA 陪跑负责人与商家对话，其他团队通过负责人协调。如果让商家直接对接五个团队，商家会陷入多头沟通，而每个团队都以为别人在推进。</p>\n<p>同时必须有一条<strong>升级路径</strong>：当某个里程碑被卡住超过约定时长（例如类目准入审批超过 5 个工作日），负责人有权把它升级到对应团队的主管，而不是无限等待。升级路径的存在本身会显著降低卡壳时长——因为被升级是一件有成本的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陪跑效果如何进入-roi-核算\">陪跑效果如何进入 ROI 核算</h2><p>KA 陪跑的投入必须能被 <a href=\"../recruit-roi-ops/recruit-channel-roi\">招商渠道 ROI 与成本</a> 核算，否则它会被当作「不算成本的特殊项目」，进而无限扩张。核算口径是把人力显式折算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>KA cost</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>bd</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>bd</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>subsidy</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>policy cost</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{KA cost} = h_{\\text{bd}} \\cdot c_{\\text{bd}} + h_{\\text{ops}} \\cdot c_{\\text{ops}} + \\text{subsidy} + \\text{policy cost}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KA cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bd</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bd</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">subsidy</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">policy cost</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>bd</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{bd}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bd</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{ops}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各自的<strong>全成本小时费率</strong>（含薪酬、福利、管理摊分），不是名义工资。政策让步的成本按 <a href=\"../bd-pipeline-negotiation/recruit-policy-incentive-pkg\">招商政策与费率/补贴谈判包</a> 的差额法计算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回收期才是-ka-的正当性来源\">回收期才是 KA 的正当性来源</h3><p>把 KA cost 与商家的实际贡献对比时，用 <strong>CAC 回收期</strong>（payback period）比用静态 ROI 更稳健——因为 KA 的价值在长周期里才显现，而静态 ROI 只看当期会系统性看低 KA。回收期定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>payback</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>KA cost</mtext><mtext>月均平台收益</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{payback} = \\frac{\\text{KA cost}}{\\text{月均平台收益}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payback</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月均平台收益</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KA cost</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>月均平台收益取入驻后前 3 个月的佣金与广告收入月均值（剔除补贴返还）。一个战略 KA 的回收期如果在 12 个月以内，通常被认为值得；超过 18 个月就需要重新审视陪跑预算是否过高。这个阈值应当由各平台根据自己的资金成本设定，而不是照搬。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么要单独核算-ka\">为什么要单独核算 KA</h3><p>一个自然的疑问是：为什么不把 KA 的成本混进整体招商成本里一起算？因为<strong>混算会掩盖两个方向的错误</strong>。一是掩盖 KA 陪跑的低效（被大量中小商家的低成本摊平）；二是掩盖 KA 政策的过度慷慨（被整体平均值稀释）。KA 是招商里唯一值得单独挂账的客群，其余一律走统一口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>KA 名单用入驻前的可观测信号判定，主观的「稀缺性」维度只能用于上浮一档，不能用于破格入列。</li>\n<li>陪跑范围明确终止于「首批商品可售且产生首单」（M3），之后的经营成长属于商家成长类 hub，不在本 hub。</li>\n<li>里程碑必须由系统判定（商品状态、订单状态），不能由陪跑人自行填写。</li>\n<li>陪跑工时必须结构化计量；<code>budget_exhausted</code> 与 <code>merchant_inactive_30d</code> 是正常退出条件，不是失败。</li>\n<li>跨团队协作保持星形拓扑，只有负责人与商家对话，并保留调升级路径。</li>\n<li>陪跑成本按全成本小时费率折算，用 CAC 回收期而非静态 ROI 判断正当性，并单独挂账以免掩盖低效或过度慷慨。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>第 3 章至此结束——从邀约落地页到注册、审核、陪跑，意向终于变成一间能经营的店铺。下一章 <a href=\"../recruit-roi-ops/recruit-channel-roi\">招商渠道 ROI 与成本</a> 开始回答最后一个问题：这一切值不值。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重点品牌 KA 落地陪跑","id":"重点品牌-ka-落地陪跑"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：谁算 KA","id":"核心概念-谁算-ka"},{"level":3,"text":"这套逻辑的通用形态：账号型拓展的分层","id":"这套逻辑的通用形态-账号型拓展的分层"},{"level":2,"text":"陪跑的范围：到首批商品可售为止","id":"陪跑的范围-到首批商品可售为止"},{"level":2,"text":"陪跑的资源投入与计量","id":"陪跑的资源投入与计量"},{"level":3,"text":"预算耗尽也是一条正常退出条件","id":"预算耗尽也是一条正常退出条件"},{"level":2,"text":"陪跑中的跨团队协作","id":"陪跑中的跨团队协作"},{"level":3,"text":"单点负责人与升级路径","id":"单点负责人与升级路径"},{"level":2,"text":"陪跑效果如何进入 ROI 核算","id":"陪跑效果如何进入-roi-核算"},{"level":3,"text":"回收期才是 KA 的正当性来源","id":"回收期才是-ka-的正当性来源"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么要单独核算 KA","id":"为什么要单独核算-ka"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"招商到入驻风控审核的交接（联 42）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/invite-conversion-handoff/recruit-to-onboarding-handoff"},"next":{"title":"招商渠道 ROI 与成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/recruit-roi-ops/recruit-channel-roi"}}